  "description": "Worked example (e): as (b) plus a €100.00 court fee paid in the client's name (art. 15, N1). Rivalsa 4 % × 1,000.00 = €40.00 (disbursement excluded); VAT 22 % × 1,040.00 = €228.80; withholding 20 % × 1,040.00 = €208.00 (disbursement excluded); amount not subject to VAT 100.00 > 77.47 -> €2.00 stamp duty charged in N1. Total 1,000.00 + 100.00 + 40.00 + 228.80 + 2.00 = €1,370.80; net payable 1,370.80 − 208.00 = €1,162.80. Summary: VAT 22 % base 1,040.00 tax 228.80; N1 base 102.00.",
